WEBVTT

00:06.250 --> 00:07.670
<b>Caelus Hildr!</b>

00:15.960 --> 00:18.210
<b>Strike evermore, immortal lightning general.</b>

00:18.500 --> 00:19.790
<b>Valiant Hildr!</b>

00:36.080 --> 00:37.080
<b>You fool!</b>

00:42.750 --> 00:43.920
<b>Stop it, Hedin!</b>

00:44.630 --> 00:45.670
<b>That's overkill!</b>

00:47.630 --> 00:48.540
<b>Are you okay?</b>

00:48.830 --> 00:51.130
<b>What are you plotting, my mortal foe?!</b>

00:51.420 --> 00:54.210
<b>How can you possibly justify such
a tyrannical display of power?!</b>

00:55.330 --> 00:58.380
<b>This harebrain won the affections
of our beloved Goddess at first sight.</b>

00:58.790 --> 01:02.380
<b>He must prove himself worthy of her love,
or nobody among us will stand for it.</b>

01:02.750 --> 01:07.080
<b>Our Goddess wishes for one thing.
And your duty is making that wish come true.</b>

01:07.330 --> 01:10.210
<b>So get up! You are obligated to keep going!</b>

01:10.630 --> 01:15.130
<b>If you are truly the Odr that she has
eagerly awaited, then stand up and prove it!</b>

01:16.210 --> 01:21.250
<b>Kyou no story toki ni yo wa irony</b>

01:21.500 --> 01:25.380
<b>"Soredemo..." tte kokoro ni</b>

01:25.380 --> 01:30.960
<b>Mitsuke dashita bokura no sekai</b>

01:40.380 --> 01:45.880
<b>Ano hi kara koko ni iru motome tsuzuke sagashiteru</b>

01:46.130 --> 01:52.670
<b>Yowasa ni deau tabi ikutsumo ikutsumo koenakucha</b>

01:52.670 --> 01:56.670
<b>Sono tabi ni namida o koraete wa</b>

01:56.920 --> 02:01.710
<b>Tachiagatte asu asatte sou yattekita no sa</b>

02:01.880 --> 02:07.000
<b>Kore made o shinjite susunda sono saki de</b>

02:07.170 --> 02:11.960
<b>Kakegaenonai mono bokura o matsu</b>

02:12.170 --> 02:16.630
<b>Bouken no story hajimari wa kyou de ii</b>

02:16.920 --> 02:22.710
<b>Itamashii elegy dare mo utawanuyou ni</b>

02:23.080 --> 02:27.630
<b>Aa tsuyoku naritai hangeki no hajimari</b>

02:27.750 --> 02:31.170
<b>Kakkowarukute ii</b>

02:31.540 --> 02:37.250
<b>Aa deai ga ai soko ni itanda ne</b>

02:46.080 --> 02:49.830
<b>Bell Cranel</b>

02:46.080 --> 02:49.830
<b>Desires</b>

02:46.290 --> 02:49.000
<b>The white rabbit is an offering to Her Ladyship.</b>

02:49.210 --> 02:51.750
<b>Inflicting this sort of sadistic pain
upon the him day after day</b>

02:52.040 --> 02:54.920
<b>shall only lead to the inevitable demise of his pure heart.</b>

02:55.210 --> 02:58.080
<b>If that is your game, then I must stand
against you as his protector!</b>

02:58.250 --> 03:00.420
<b>Hmph. Since when are you such a sap?</b>

03:00.710 --> 03:03.000
<b>Are you trying to tell me you consider
that harebrain a friend?</b>

03:03.000 --> 03:04.130
<b>F-friend?!</b>

03:04.250 --> 03:07.500
<b>No, no, no! I mean, he is a r-rather virtuous
and gentle soul for a human.</b>

03:06.380 --> 03:07.330
<b>Hedin.</b>

03:07.500 --> 03:10.880
<b>Even when I fall into mayhem of chaos,
he is kind enough to interact with me...</b>

03:07.830 --> 03:11.460
<b>I know Lady Freya granted you the
responsibility of educating Bell Cranel.</b>

03:11.750 --> 03:15.460
<b>But your excessively brutal treatment of him
these past few days is unacceptable.</b>

03:17.500 --> 03:19.880
<b>You claim it's how he can prove
himself worthy as her partner,</b>

03:20.130 --> 03:22.380
<b>but I suspect you have other reasons aside from that.</b>

03:26.130 --> 03:28.960
<b>Your eyes must be empty holes given how blind you are.</b>

03:28.960 --> 03:29.790
<b>What?</b>

03:30.130 --> 03:33.380
<b>The one facing the most stress from being
backed into a corner isn't the harebrain.</b>

03:33.540 --> 03:34.960
<b>It's Lady Freya.</b>

03:36.040 --> 03:40.500
<b>Despite his fatigue, Bell Cranel has remained
resilient and not succumbed to our ploy,</b>

03:40.500 --> 03:43.210
<b>which has inversely begun to agitate Her Ladyship.</b>

03:44.210 --> 03:50.540
<b>It's true. I've noticed that Lady Freya has been spending
more time ruminating alone about something lately.</b>

03:52.130 --> 03:54.170
<b>Almost as if she were questioning her choices...</b>

03:55.080 --> 03:57.460
<b>His strong sentimentality has kept her charms at bay,</b>

03:57.460 --> 03:59.750
<b>and now the plan is working
against us by rattling our Goddess.</b>

04:00.080 --> 04:03.130
<b>We have to hurry and put enough pressure on
the harebrain to cause him a mental breakdown.</b>

04:03.580 --> 04:07.040
<b>Furbrain. You will participate in
his christening starting tomorrow.</b>

04:07.040 --> 04:09.330
<b>You know my job is keep tabs on the tavern.</b>

04:09.750 --> 04:12.000
<b>We can't leave that monstrously
powerful Dwarf to her own devi-</b>

04:12.000 --> 04:14.920
<b>Quit using Mia as a convenient
excuse to avoid doing anything.</b>

04:15.830 --> 04:20.830
<b>Or is this about your dimwitted sister who you can't
seem to get over despite abandoning her once before?</b>

04:21.540 --> 04:23.420
<b>Say another word and die, maggot!</b>

04:24.000 --> 04:27.040
<b>Her Ladyship is in trouble. Do your part.</b>

04:29.080 --> 04:29.750
<b>Tch!</b>

04:30.170 --> 04:30.960
<b>Ottarl.</b>

04:31.170 --> 04:32.420
<b>We could use you, too.</b>

04:32.830 --> 04:35.710
<b>Adding me to the mix is too much. You can handle it.</b>

04:38.080 --> 04:39.630
<b>Quit being so damn merciful.</b>

04:40.420 --> 04:42.000
<b>We have to utterly crush him.</b>

04:43.330 --> 04:44.670
<b>Hey, Welf!</b>

04:44.670 --> 04:46.960
<b>Lend me the key to the workshop, would ya?</b>

04:47.710 --> 04:50.290
<b>Okay, but why do you need to get in the workshop?</b>

04:50.670 --> 04:54.000
<b>I can't find the bill that shows
I owe 200 million valis in debt.</b>

04:54.000 --> 04:55.330
<b>So I'm looking for it.</b>

04:55.540 --> 04:59.670
<b>Well, that's not good. But I'm pretty sure nothing
like that is in the workshop.</b>

05:00.080 --> 05:01.420
<b>By the way, Welf,</b>

05:01.540 --> 05:03.420
<b>what have you been up to in here?</b>

05:03.790 --> 05:05.830
<b>Organizing all of my old work.</b>

05:06.500 --> 05:08.330
<b>Since we're running out of space.</b>

05:08.830 --> 05:09.710
<b>But it's weird...</b>

05:10.750 --> 05:14.710
<b>Why did I even bother making all this light armor?</b>

05:14.920 --> 05:17.630
<b>There's nobody in our party who can even use it.</b>

05:19.380 --> 05:21.540
<b>But, ya know, this speaks to me as a blacksmith.</b>

05:21.790 --> 05:24.960
<b>I can tell that I put a lot of care into forging it.</b>

05:25.290 --> 05:29.460
<b>Almost like I made it for a specific person,
someone who I was on the same wavelength with...</b>

05:29.460 --> 05:30.460
<b>Welf...</b>

05:33.170 --> 05:34.670
<b>It's okay if you don't remember the details.</b>

05:35.170 --> 05:38.880
<b>But take those feelings to heart. It means you have
a special bond with an adventurer somewhere.</b>

05:45.170 --> 05:47.000
<b>My apologies for making you go
to the trouble of coming here.</b>

05:47.540 --> 05:49.420
<b>I wanted to talk in a secure place
where nobody could eavesdrop.</b>

05:49.000 --> 05:51.460
<b>Oh, Asfi!</b>

05:53.290 --> 05:54.630
<b>Please calm down.</b>

05:54.920 --> 05:56.920
<b>Someone will catch on if you make a big fuss.</b>

06:00.540 --> 06:04.960
<b>I was surprised when I came across this,
but I knew right away that it was from you.</b>

06:07.380 --> 06:10.460
<b>Let's start by sharing what we know, Goddess Hestia.</b>

06:14.500 --> 06:18.170
<b>Is that true? The Freya Familia is getting desperate?</b>

06:18.330 --> 06:19.040
<b>Yes.</b>

06:19.580 --> 06:21.630
<b>Their attempts to wear Bell Cranel down are escalating.</b>

06:22.130 --> 06:23.920
<b>They've been using all of their first-class adventurers</b>

06:23.920 --> 06:27.040
<b>as part of "training" sessions that
are clearly made to break him.</b>

06:29.380 --> 06:31.380
<b>This is just my gut speaking,</b>

06:32.000 --> 06:35.830
<b>but something is putting the Freya Familia
on pins and needles.</b>

06:36.630 --> 06:39.170
<b>I don't get it. Why are they so frantic?</b>

06:39.630 --> 06:42.920
<b>Freya's charm has mesmerized the entirety of Orario.</b>

06:43.380 --> 06:47.880
<b>Every God and child in the city is under
her control, except for you and me.</b>

06:48.080 --> 06:49.130
<b>So what's the deal?</b>

06:49.380 --> 06:51.170
<b>If I had to guess, it's because of Bell Cranel.</b>

06:52.380 --> 06:56.080
<b>They're losing their patience because he has yet
to succumb to the new reality created by her powers.</b>

06:57.080 --> 07:00.500
<b>But given the kind of harsh treatment
they're putting him through,</b>

07:01.000 --> 07:04.580
<b>it wouldn't surprise me if Bell Cranel lost
his will to resist at any point now.</b>

07:05.330 --> 07:06.960
<b>So they're distracted, huh?</b>

07:08.790 --> 07:11.000
<b>Is this what Hermes meant by "when the time is right"?</b>

07:16.630 --> 07:19.290
<b>Man... what am I doing here?</b>

07:19.880 --> 07:22.830
<b>Nearly dying, then being brought back...</b>

07:23.460 --> 07:26.830
<b>Eating, sleeping, then fighting again...</b>

07:27.250 --> 07:28.710
<b>It's a vicious cycle.</b>

07:31.710 --> 07:35.420
<b>Who was it? Who's the person I was striving to reach?</b>

07:36.170 --> 07:38.000
<b>And where was I trying to get back to?</b>

07:42.580 --> 07:43.670
<b>Say, Bell?</b>

07:43.960 --> 07:45.420
<b>Let's sleep together tonight.</b>

07:46.670 --> 07:48.540
<b>I won't do anything to you.</b>

07:49.710 --> 07:52.210
<b>I promise. So stay here.</b>

07:53.210 --> 07:53.920
<b>Okay?</b>

07:56.670 --> 07:59.210
<b>Is there anything you want, Bell?</b>

07:59.710 --> 08:02.670
<b>Power? Money? Hero status?</b>

08:02.670 --> 08:04.170
<b>Control of the world?</b>

08:04.630 --> 08:06.750
<b>Or maybe someone's love?</b>

08:07.750 --> 08:09.540
<b>I'll give you whatever you want.</b>

08:10.460 --> 08:12.920
<b>I don't need anything.</b>

08:14.630 --> 08:16.040
<b>I figured you'd say that.</b>

08:17.040 --> 08:19.670
<b>That's exactly why I fell in love with you.</b>

08:25.130 --> 08:28.380
<b>I love you, Bell. With all my heart.</b>

08:29.420 --> 08:31.830
<b>Maybe... I should just give up.</b>

08:32.750 --> 08:38.040
<b>This is reality. All those old memories
and feelings that I had must be wrong.</b>

08:38.540 --> 08:41.290
<b>I mean, it's just too cozy here.</b>

08:41.710 --> 08:43.630
<b>This is where my heart feels at ease.</b>

08:43.880 --> 08:47.040
<b>Because I can forget everything
that bothers me while I'm here.</b>

08:48.040 --> 08:49.040
<b>So whatever.</b>

08:49.290 --> 08:52.420
<b>This is fine. I'll stay cozy here.</b>

08:55.540 --> 09:00.130
<b>Wait, but then... why did I turn her down?</b>

09:01.040 --> 09:03.000
<b>What did I have to hurt Ms. Syr for?</b>

09:03.460 --> 09:05.130
<b>I made her cry!</b>

09:05.630 --> 09:07.880
<b>Even if that was all just a dream,</b>

09:08.330 --> 09:09.920
<b>I can never forget those tears.</b>

09:10.580 --> 09:12.040
<b>I'm an idiot.</b>

09:12.830 --> 09:17.380
<b>Despite all this comfort being offered to me,
I can't manage to lie to myself.</b>

09:30.210 --> 09:31.290
<b>You're going out again today?</b>

09:33.420 --> 09:35.880
<b>Yes. To look for Ms. Syr.</b>

09:36.330 --> 09:37.880
<b>Don't make me repeat myself.</b>

09:38.250 --> 09:42.130
<b>We looked into it, but no such person
exists anywhere in Orario.</b>

09:42.540 --> 09:44.920
<b>She's nothing but an illusion that your mind created.</b>

09:45.330 --> 09:47.710
<b>Even so... I don't want to accept that.</b>

09:47.710 --> 09:48.710
<b>Enough is enough.</b>

09:48.710 --> 09:49.330
<b>Huh?</b>

09:49.500 --> 09:53.290
<b>Lady Freya has been concerned about your well-being,
so we've had guards following you.</b>

09:53.790 --> 09:55.210
<b>But it's just a waste of manpower.</b>

09:55.790 --> 09:56.540
<b>Master...</b>

09:57.920 --> 09:58.920
<b>Mr. Hedin?</b>

09:59.880 --> 10:01.460
<b>Am I crazy?</b>

10:02.210 --> 10:05.210
<b>Whether your behavior is sacrilegious
or not makes no difference.</b>

10:06.170 --> 10:07.130
<b>Forge ahead.</b>

10:08.290 --> 10:10.080
<b>Because you don't get the option of standing still.</b>

10:12.210 --> 10:14.630
<b>Have all the guards and observers
stop following Bell Cranel.</b>

10:14.790 --> 10:16.420
<b>A-are you sure, sir?!</b>

10:16.750 --> 10:19.380
<b>I mean, it's true that Bell just walks
through the town every day,</b>

10:19.380 --> 10:21.250
<b>and never really does anything...</b>

10:21.670 --> 10:22.830
<b>We have bigger problems.</b>

10:23.250 --> 10:24.830
<b>There are signs that the Loki Familia are preparing</b>

10:24.830 --> 10:27.040
<b>to return to the city after an expedition
down in the Deep Floors.</b>

10:28.130 --> 10:31.580
<b>That includes Lady Riveria and more.
They are a significant force to reckon with.</b>

10:31.880 --> 10:35.210
<b>We must take all possible measures to ensure
that Lady Freya's "sandbox" doesn't get ruined.</b>

10:35.540 --> 10:37.000
<b>You will await them outside the Tower of Babel,</b>

10:37.000 --> 10:40.460
<b>and see to it they all get charmed
upon leaving the dungeon.</b>

10:40.790 --> 10:43.380
<b>Allen, Alfrigg, and the others are already headed there.</b>

10:43.830 --> 10:45.000
<b>Understood.</b>

10:45.330 --> 10:48.130
<b>Take everyone who is second-class and higher with you.</b>

10:48.540 --> 10:51.330
<b>You have my permission to remove
any permanent guards from their posts as well.</b>

10:51.580 --> 10:52.250
<b>Yessir!</b>

10:54.210 --> 10:57.000
<b>Okay, but are you really sure about this?</b>

10:57.210 --> 10:59.420
<b>It's risky, even if Bell's spirit is broken at this point...</b>

10:59.670 --> 11:02.580
<b>It's not a problem. I'll keep watch over him myself.</b>

11:02.880 --> 11:03.880
<b>Hey, check it out.</b>

11:03.880 --> 11:06.710
<b>Don't make eye contact, dumbass.
He's with the Freya Familia.</b>

11:05.630 --> 11:07.000
<b>That's Rabbit's Foot.</b>

11:07.000 --> 11:11.540
<b>Ugh, I hate the fact that I've gotten
used to this. It disgusts me.</b>

11:07.000 --> 11:08.080
<b>Just shut up.</b>

11:08.080 --> 11:10.170
<b>It's best to let sleeping dogs lie, man.</b>

11:12.710 --> 11:15.290
<b>Greetings! Firewood delivery for ya!</b>

11:15.670 --> 11:17.460
<b>Ah, thank you so much.</b>

11:17.460 --> 11:20.250
<b>Is Lord Ganesha not handling it this year?</b>

11:20.630 --> 11:22.580
<b>Well, everyone seems to be busy...</b>

11:22.580 --> 11:24.210
<b>We got the short end of the stick!</b>

11:24.460 --> 11:25.420
<b>Shush, Lulune.</b>

11:25.420 --> 11:26.580
<b>But it's true!</b>

11:31.790 --> 11:33.130
<b>Like I said before!</b>

11:33.130 --> 11:36.380
<b>There's nobody at this tavern named Syr, period!</b>

11:36.710 --> 11:38.630
<b>Give it a rest, fur crying out loud.</b>

11:38.830 --> 11:42.540
<b>You must be psycatic to go around every day and
purrtend some imaginary girl that you made up exists.</b>

11:42.670 --> 11:44.790
<b>Quit bothering us and just get lost.</b>

11:45.000 --> 11:47.080
<b>We have a lot of work to do.</b>

11:47.080 --> 11:50.080
<b>Especially since Anya won't
be able to help any time soon.</b>

11:50.080 --> 11:52.250
<b>And our Elf coworker still hasn't come back, either.</b>

11:53.960 --> 11:56.080
<b>Everybody remembers who Ms. Ryu is.</b>

11:56.630 --> 11:58.460
<b>So why don't they know Ms. Syr?</b>

11:58.460 --> 12:00.130
<b>What're you boneheads doing?!</b>

12:00.380 --> 12:02.210
<b>If you've got time to waste, then go pick up supplies!</b>

12:02.210 --> 12:03.580
<b>Yes ma'am!</b>

12:15.080 --> 12:15.920
<b>Hey, kid.</b>

12:16.460 --> 12:17.210
<b>Uh, yeah?</b>

12:17.500 --> 12:20.170
<b>I won't give the Goddess any lip.</b>

12:20.420 --> 12:23.880
<b>Since I promised not to interfere
when "that day" finally came.</b>

12:23.880 --> 12:28.420
<b>No matter how tempted I am to beat the living daylights
out of those assholes who laid a hand on my stupid girls.</b>

12:28.670 --> 12:30.790
<b>Um... what do you mean?</b>

12:30.790 --> 12:33.670
<b>That I'm part of the Freya Familia.</b>

12:34.830 --> 12:37.250
<b>Except I'm basically half-resigned from that lot.</b>

12:37.380 --> 12:40.420
<b>I'm an outcast who refuses
to help the Familia with anything.</b>

12:40.420 --> 12:43.420
<b>And what I'm about to say is outright mutinous.</b>

12:45.880 --> 12:49.580
<b>Nobody gets very far as an adventurer
by just trying to be cool.</b>

12:50.920 --> 12:56.040
<b>It doesn't matter how pathetic or laughable they look.
The ones who come back alive are the true winners.</b>

12:56.420 --> 13:00.040
<b>Whoever is left standing on their two legs
at the end is the best of the best.</b>

13:00.710 --> 13:04.880
<b>So listen, you just believe in yourself
and keep on running.</b>

13:05.170 --> 13:08.420
<b>Ms. Mia... are you implying that...?</b>

13:08.420 --> 13:10.460
<b>Alright! Get on, scoot!</b>

13:10.670 --> 13:12.040
<b>Yer getting in the way of business!</b>

13:12.040 --> 13:15.040
<b>And don't come back until you've found
a way to wipe that sorry look off your face!</b>

13:16.790 --> 13:17.960
<b>I'm sorry!</b>

13:24.960 --> 13:27.630
<b>Ms. Mia... she's said that before...</b>

13:28.540 --> 13:33.210
<b>Kid, you won't get very far as
an adventurer by just trying to be cool.</b>

13:34.130 --> 13:39.500
<b>Okay, so, does that mean Ms. Mia remembers
our conversation from half a year ago?</b>

13:39.750 --> 13:42.460
<b>That I'm part of the Freya Familia.</b>

13:42.670 --> 13:45.540
<b>And what I'm about to say is outright mutinous.</b>

13:46.290 --> 13:48.130
<b>What was she trying to get at?</b>

13:54.170 --> 13:56.790
<b>But... no matter what really happened...</b>

13:57.130 --> 13:58.330
<b>Enough is enough.</b>

13:58.670 --> 14:01.540
<b>There's nobody at this tavern named Syr, period!</b>

14:02.920 --> 14:05.330
<b>I can't do anything now.</b>

14:05.920 --> 14:07.500
<b>I don't want to get hurt anymore.</b>

14:08.000 --> 14:10.380
<b>Accepting this as reality will take all the weight off.</b>

14:11.000 --> 14:13.330
<b>I just need to surrender everything to Lady Freya...</b>

14:17.580 --> 14:18.380
<b>Legs?</b>

14:19.330 --> 14:20.710
<b>My own two legs?</b>

14:21.790 --> 14:24.710
<b>Whoever is left standing on two legs at the end...</b>

14:26.380 --> 14:27.920
<b>All I can do is stand here.</b>

14:28.330 --> 14:32.290
<b>There's nothing I can do except stand here
and believe in myself.</b>

14:33.750 --> 14:36.250
<b>That's right. I'm still standing!</b>

14:36.630 --> 14:38.790
<b>Don't run away. Don't get scared.</b>

14:39.170 --> 14:41.330
<b>No matter how pathetic or laughable I may look...</b>

14:41.630 --> 14:44.080
<b>I have to believe in myself!</b>

14:45.500 --> 14:46.460
<b>And run.</b>

14:47.380 --> 14:48.040
<b>Run!</b>

14:49.420 --> 14:52.630
<b>There's one person left who I haven't seen yet!</b>

14:53.920 --> 14:56.880
<b>Hey, Ais. What do you feel like for lunch today?</b>

14:57.210 --> 14:58.500
<b>Anything's fine.</b>

14:58.500 --> 15:00.630
<b>You know it's pointless to ask her.</b>

15:00.630 --> 15:01.630
<b>Ms. Ais!</b>

15:06.670 --> 15:08.790
<b>What? Is he from the Freya Familia?</b>

15:08.790 --> 15:13.250
<b>Yeah. It's that "Something Foot" kid who
Loki told us to be super careful around.</b>

15:13.250 --> 15:14.960
<b>What do you want with Ais?</b>

15:15.420 --> 15:18.130
<b>Ms. Ais. Do you know who I am?</b>

15:18.580 --> 15:20.670
<b>Do you remember all the times we've met before?</b>

15:21.830 --> 15:24.250
<b>What kind of crazy nonsense is he talking about?</b>

15:24.540 --> 15:27.710
<b>Move aside! We're under orders
not to associate with you guys!</b>

15:28.500 --> 15:29.670
<b>Let's go, Ais.</b>

15:37.330 --> 15:38.170
<b>Ais!</b>

15:38.380 --> 15:39.670
<b>What are you doing?!</b>

15:44.750 --> 15:47.250
<b>Do you want... to train?</b>

15:47.750 --> 15:48.540
<b>Huh?!</b>

15:49.290 --> 15:53.250
<b>It feels like I've made you pass out many times...</b>

15:54.210 --> 15:57.330
<b>Then let you lay on my lap and recover...</b>

15:57.920 --> 15:59.790
<b>So I could beat you again...</b>

16:00.790 --> 16:04.750
<b>Something tells me that we should
be fighting up on that wall over there.</b>

16:05.630 --> 16:09.920
<b>That I should be teaching you,
so that I can also learn from the experience.</b>

16:12.290 --> 16:13.830
<b>It was a promise I made with someone...</b>

16:14.960 --> 16:16.670
<b>after they told me they wanted to be stronger.</b>

16:17.040 --> 16:18.540
<b>That's what I feel in my heart.</b>

16:23.630 --> 16:25.500
<b>I've never been more glad that you...</b>

16:27.170 --> 16:28.630
<b>are the person I admire!</b>

16:42.460 --> 16:44.580
<b>I remember it! I remember it all!</b>

16:44.960 --> 16:46.790
<b>Everything that she taught me!</b>

16:49.420 --> 16:52.250
<b>I am NOT part of the Freya Familia!</b>

16:52.880 --> 16:55.380
<b>The whole world may try to tell me otherwise,</b>

16:56.080 --> 16:58.710
<b>but the skills and tactics that
I learned from her are my proof!</b>

16:59.130 --> 17:00.420
<b>They're ingrained in my body!</b>

17:02.040 --> 17:04.210
<b>Fight evermore, my immortal lightning warriors.</b>

17:05.420 --> 17:06.750
<b>Caelus Hildr!</b>

17:07.580 --> 17:09.330
<b>Fire Bolt!</b>

17:14.580 --> 17:16.080
<b>Landing the final blow is...</b>

17:17.290 --> 17:18.920
<b>when they're most vulnerable!</b>

17:29.880 --> 17:32.580
<b>He landed a hit on my mortal foe?!</b>

17:35.250 --> 17:36.630
<b>This is who I am.</b>

17:38.790 --> 17:40.920
<b>I am... Bell Cranel!</b>

17:45.710 --> 17:47.540
<b>Don't get cocky just because you scratched me!</b>

17:48.290 --> 17:52.130
<b>I'm tempted to beat the tar out of you
to make sure it won't go to your head, but...</b>

17:53.500 --> 17:54.420
<b>time's up.</b>

17:58.580 --> 17:59.960
<b>Aw, jeez.</b>

17:59.960 --> 18:03.460
<b>I can't believe how much work
piles up when the captain ain't around.</b>

18:03.710 --> 18:06.500
<b>It's bad enough we got put in charge
of delivering firewood this year.</b>

18:06.750 --> 18:08.830
<b>What the hell is the Guild thinking?</b>

18:08.830 --> 18:11.580
<b>I wish they'd just let us do it all at once.</b>

18:11.580 --> 18:14.250
<b>But no, we gotta start with small
deliveries on the edge of town.</b>

18:14.580 --> 18:17.380
<b>Master Hermes! What's the deal with this job?!</b>

18:18.790 --> 18:21.380
<b>Oh crap. Am I stuck in a loop?</b>

18:22.460 --> 18:27.040
<b>Yeah, I keep losing my memory.
Then repeating things over in a loop.</b>

18:27.040 --> 18:29.630
<b>And the worst part, it isn't just once or twice.</b>

18:30.170 --> 18:32.920
<b>My past self has tried to figure out what was wrong,</b>

18:32.920 --> 18:36.540
<b>but every time I took notes of my findings,
my memory would get reset</b>

18:36.960 --> 18:39.080
<b>and then I'd get rid of the notes.</b>

18:40.290 --> 18:41.630
<b>What is going on?</b>

18:42.130 --> 18:47.670
<b>Something powerful enough to escape my detection
must have taken control of my life.</b>

18:48.040 --> 18:52.210
<b>Say, have I given you guys any messages to pass on?</b>

18:52.210 --> 18:53.830
<b>Jeez, you're asking again?</b>

18:54.290 --> 18:56.420
<b>How many times do we have to go through this?</b>

18:56.790 --> 18:59.540
<b>You keep making us remember all
these weird words in a certain order.</b>

18:59.750 --> 19:02.580
<b>Sorry. Just consider it one of my divine pastimes.</b>

19:02.750 --> 19:05.330
<b>Let's see. First was "loop".</b>

19:05.580 --> 19:06.880
<b>Then "reset"...</b>

19:08.880 --> 19:12.380
<b>"Loop." "Reset." "Not just me."</b>

19:12.630 --> 19:18.290
<b>"The world." "Being distorted."
"Under powerful control." "Nobody remembers."</b>

19:18.290 --> 19:22.080
<b>"Certain information." "Unable to acknowledge."
"Maybe cognitive tampering."</b>

19:22.460 --> 19:23.830
<b>Since taking notes didn't work,</b>

19:23.830 --> 19:27.880
<b>I fed my children with fragments of information
as a way to skirt around the rules.</b>

19:28.250 --> 19:31.000
<b>Way to go, past me. That was a brilliant idea.</b>

19:32.580 --> 19:35.750
<b>The level of discomfort I currently feel from
this situation must still be in the safe zone.</b>

19:36.000 --> 19:38.500
<b>But if that turns into legitimate suspicion,</b>

19:38.500 --> 19:42.710
<b>or if I make any attempts to figure out who and what
might be causing this, my memories get erased.</b>

19:44.000 --> 19:48.500
<b>So I have to think without thinking too hard?
That's ridiculous.</b>

19:48.960 --> 19:52.080
<b>Besides, there's only one person I know even capable
of...</b>

19:58.750 --> 20:02.500
<b>From what I can tell,
whoever created this "sandbox" we're in</b>

20:02.500 --> 20:04.580
<b>is someone that wants this world to remain peaceful.</b>

20:05.130 --> 20:07.460
<b>Their goal isn't the downfall of Orario.</b>

20:07.460 --> 20:10.040
<b>In fact, they've made sure
it remains the capital of heroes.</b>

20:10.750 --> 20:14.920
<b>The only reason they would go to that much trouble is
because there is a some element they cannot control.</b>

20:14.920 --> 20:19.290
<b>So they were forced to distort
the entire world around that one thing instead.</b>

20:20.380 --> 20:22.380
<b>However, there is no way out of this.</b>

20:22.710 --> 20:26.460
<b>Because my memory will get wiped again
the instant that I come up with a solution.</b>

20:26.460 --> 20:28.290
<b>And I'll just be back at square one.</b>

20:28.960 --> 20:31.380
<b>It's impossible to take any kind of spontaneous action.</b>

20:32.420 --> 20:33.710
<b>I wish I had some guidance.</b>

20:34.000 --> 20:38.420
<b>Like external directions that I can just follow through
with and never consider their true purpose.</b>

20:39.130 --> 20:43.920
<b>Of course, there's no guarantee that I won't run afoul
of the rules if I go looking for something like that.</b>

20:44.750 --> 20:48.040
<b>But considering the reason why
past me left this inside my hat,</b>

20:48.380 --> 20:50.830
<b>and the fact that Asfi isn't around right now...</b>

20:51.210 --> 20:54.000
<b>I have one last hope.</b>

21:02.210 --> 21:03.920
<b>ASFI!</b>

21:03.920 --> 21:06.830
<b>I LOVE YOU, BABY! IT'S ALL MY FAULT!</b>

21:07.040 --> 21:09.960
<b>PLEASE COME BAAAAACK!</b>

21:11.460 --> 21:13.670
<b>The potato popper stand on North Avenue.</b>

21:18.920 --> 21:21.330
<b>Talk about perfect timing, Hermes!</b>

21:21.920 --> 21:24.130
<b>I'm gonna get fired if I don't meet my quota for today!</b>

21:24.330 --> 21:27.040
<b>I'm selling the Hyper Ultra Potato Popper Deluxe!</b>

21:27.290 --> 21:30.040
<b>And guess what? The price just doubled
because you showed up!</b>

21:30.040 --> 21:32.920
<b>Buy it! Buy it now, Hermes!</b>

21:37.790 --> 21:39.830
<b>Oof, I ate too much.</b>

21:43.290 --> 21:45.540
<b>"Make a hearth out of Orario."</b>

21:46.630 --> 21:50.210
<b>Oh, that's perfect. Exactly what I'd expect from me.</b>

21:50.750 --> 21:53.250
<b>Alrighty, then. I won't think about anything.</b>

21:53.880 --> 21:58.080
<b>I'll just do what this paper says.
And just be a guy doing a job.</b>

21:58.960 --> 22:01.540
<b>It's time to get cracking! And make a hearth!</b>

22:19.080 --> 22:21.710
<b>Kono himitsu shizume</b>

22:21.710 --> 22:24.170
<b>Yuredasu suimen ni</b>

22:24.580 --> 22:28.750
<b>Kizuku yochi ga atta mitai</b>

22:29.540 --> 22:36.250
<b>Umaku arawasenai sore de ite masshiro na omoi</b>

22:36.250 --> 22:39.420
<b>Yobeba mata hoshiku naru</b>

22:39.420 --> 22:44.420
<b>Hayaru kanjou sore wa uneru nami no you</b>

22:44.790 --> 22:50.000
<b>Chikutto sotto shirazu ni hareteku</b>

22:51.080 --> 22:57.630
<b>Soshite hedateta kabe kuzurete rikai shita kotoba wa</b>

22:57.750 --> 23:02.080
<b>Tada yuratto sora ni ukanderu</b>

23:02.580 --> 23:08.130
<b>Tatoe kara demo koeteku ai hoshii</b>

23:08.380 --> 23:13.710
<b>Douse yume nara uso mo tsuredashite</b>

23:13.710 --> 23:17.380
<b>Tatoe ubaenai sei demo</b>

23:17.500 --> 23:22.960
<b>Kokoro o sukoshi mitashite kawaru</b>

23:23.250 --> 23:28.920
<b>Memai no you na muku na kasumi</b>

23:36.080 --> 23:41.040
<b>Next time</b>

23:36.080 --> 23:41.040
<b>Vesta</b>

23:36.090 --> 23:41.040
<b>Alter of the Sacred Flame</b>

23:36.880 --> 23:38.710
<b>Next time: "Vesta".</b>
